cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these training materials, please cite them as below."
title: "Xenium Data Analysis Training: a 4-week course on spatial transcriptomics analysis with R and Xenium Explorer"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-11-10"
abstract: >-
  Course materials for a 4-week introduction to 10x Genomics Xenium in situ
  spatial transcriptomics data analysis: Xenium output files and QC, Xenium
  Explorer, clustering and dimension reduction in Seurat, and marker gene
  detection, using a public 10x Genomics mouse brain dataset. Notebooks
  verified with R 4.4.3 and Seurat 5.5.1 (November 2026).
authors:
